---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CategoryIcon from '../components/CategoryIcon.astro';
import {categoryArt, type CategoryArtName} from '../data/category-art';
import {icons, type IconName} from '../data/icons';
import {withBase} from '../lib/urls';
const entries = Object.entries(icons) as [IconName, (typeof icons)[IconName]][];
---
<Layout title="新物的图标设计 · 新物">
<div class="container design-page">
  <section class="design-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">新物视觉语言 · 第二版</span><h1>一眼认出，<br/>这是哪件新物。</h1><p>为硬件分类画一组有质感的小物件。<br/>柔和的颜色，熟悉的轮廓，还有一点新物橙。</p></div><div class="brand-specimen"><img src={withBase('/favicon.svg')} width="120" height="120" alt="新物标志：打开的圆角框、一枚圆点和加号"/><div><strong>新物 · 发现新的可能</strong><p>打开的框，代表探索；<br/>框外的圆点，代表刚发现的新物。</p><a download="xinwu-brand.svg" href={withBase('/favicon.svg')}>下载品牌标志 SVG</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="design-principles"><article><span>01</span><h2>先读文字，再认图形</h2><p>“查看产品”“前往品牌官网”直接说明去向。图标帮助识别，不代替说明。</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>从硬件本身取形</h2><p>镜片、录音器、机器人和随身设备，各自有清楚的轮廓。用具体物件表达类别。</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>让质感各司其职</h2><p>分类入口用有体积感的小物件，日常操作用清楚的细线。整站共享圆角、留白与新物橙。</p></article></section>
  <section class="category-showcase" aria-label="新物彩色分类图标">
    <div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">新物小物件 · 5 枚分类图标</span><h2>把硬件，放进一个小方块。</h2></div><span class="small-muted">圆润机身 / 柔和光线 / 橙色细节</span></div>
    <div class="category-art-board">{(Object.keys(categoryArt) as CategoryArtName[]).map(name=><article><CategoryIcon name={name} size={144}/><h3>{categoryArt[name].label}</h3><p>{categoryArt[name].description}</p><a href={withBase(`/category-icons/${name}.svg`)} download={`xinwu-category-${name}.svg`}>下载分类图标</a></article>)}</div>
    <p class="category-art-note">这些小物件代表产品类别，不指代具体品牌。首页与产品库使用同一套图标，中文名称始终保留。</p>
  </section>
  <section class="icon-catalog"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">16 枚基础线条图标</span><h2>每一枚，都有确定的意思。</h2></div><div class="icon-size-controls" aria-label="调整图标预览大小"><span>实际尺寸</span>{[20,24,32].map(size=><button data-preview-size={size} aria-pressed={size===24}>{size}px</button>)}</div></div><div class="icon-board">{entries.map(([name,icon])=><article><div class="icon-specimen"><Icon name={name} size={24}/></div><h3>{icon.label}</h3><p>{icon.meaning}</p><a href={withBase(`/icons/${name}.svg`)} download={`xinwu-${name}.svg`}>下载 SVG</a></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="design-comparison"><div><span class="eyebrow">在页面里，怎么使用</span><h2>把“这是干什么的”，<br/>写在按钮上。</h2><p>站内阅读、外部网站、文件导出分别说明。不能点击的内容不画操作箭头。</p></div><div class="button-specimens"><article><span>站内阅读</span><a href={withBase('/products/even-g1/')} class="button">查看产品介绍</a><p>打开新物里的产品详情页。</p></article><article><span>站外浏览</span><a href="https://www.evenrealities.com/g1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button light">前往品牌官网 <Icon name="external" size={18}/></a><p>在新窗口打开品牌网站。</p></article><article><span>保存文件</span><a href={withBase('/icons/recorder.svg')} download="xinwu-recorder.svg" class="button light"><Icon name="download" size={18}/>下载录音器图标</a><p>将 SVG 文件保存到当前设备。</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="design-tokens"><div><span class="eyebrow">统一的小细节</span><h2>温暖、清楚，有硬件的质感。</h2></div><div class="swatches"><div><i style="background:#e75b36"></i><strong>新物橙</strong><span>品牌与少量点缀</span></div><div><i style="background:#242623"></i><strong>石墨黑</strong><span>轮廓与主要文字</span></div><div><i style="background:#faf9f6;border:1px solid #deded5"></i><strong>纸白</strong><span>背景与呼吸空间</span></div><div><i class="stroke-sample"></i><strong>圆角细线</strong><span>24 格画布 · 1.65 线宽</span></div></div><p class="small-muted">图标全新绘制，基础形状保留常见含义。第三方平台使用“B站”“小红书”文字名称，不自造容易误认的官方标志。</p></section>
  <section class="design-references"><span class="eyebrow">造型与使用方式的参考</span><h2>这次从其他网站学到了什么。</h2><div><article><a href="https://developer.apple.com/cn/design/awards/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple 设计大奖 · 2026</a><p>Tide Guide 的海浪仪表、Moonlitt 的立体形状，展示了小图标也能有鲜明主体与层次。新物借鉴这种表达方式，全新绘制自己的硬件物件。</p></article><article><a href="https://nothing.tech/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nothing</a><p>按钮写出 Discover、Learn more 等操作。品牌风格可以鲜明，操作含义仍然要清楚。</p></article><article><a href="https://www.nngroup.com/articles/icon-usability/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NN/g 图标可用性研究</a><p>大部分图标没有通用含义，需要文字标签降低歧义。新物的功能图标始终配有说明。</p></article></div></section>
</div>
<script>
  const board=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.icon-board');
  const buttons=document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-preview-size]');
  buttons.forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const size=Number(button.dataset.previewSize);if(![20,24,32].includes(size))return;board?.style.setProperty('--preview-size',`${size}px`);buttons.forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button)));}));
</script>
</Layout>
